OL,3,ASabotage suspect held in Germany after
OL,4,Aspate of attacks on power grid
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe suspect, named by German media as
OL,7,FDaniel V, is believed to have written
OL,8,Fletters claiming responsibility for the
OL,9,Fattacks, which have taken place in
OL,10,FBrandenburg and Saxony in the east as
OL,11,Fwell North Rhine-Westphalia in the
OL,12,Fwest.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
